{
  "id": "scouts-zombie-the-camp",
  "title": "Scouts Guide to the Zombie Apocalypse",
  "sourceTitle": "Scouts Guide to the Zombie Apocalypse",
  "kind": "movie",
  "synopsis": "Your scout troop's overnight camp goes badly when, somehow, half of town becomes flesh-eating. You have a sash, three badges, and a slingshot. Use them.",
  "releaseYear": 2015,
  "addedAt": "2026-04-07T00:00:00Z",
  "genre": "Comedy",
  "tags": [
    "zombies",
    "scouts",
    "small-town"
  ],
  "rating": 3,
  "loved": false,
  "nextStoryId": null,
  "startNodeId": "s1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "Saturday morning. Troop leader is missing. Cocoa is cold. You and Carter and Augie find a zombie behind the storage shed.",
      "sceneTitle": "Pancakes, Optional",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Scream",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay quiet",
          "consequence": "Tactical.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Carter wants to drive to the police station. The police station is, by Augie's count, two miles.",
      "sceneTitle": "Carter's Plan",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Walk",
          "consequence": "Slow but safe.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bike",
          "consequence": "Faster.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Augie has, on his sash, a 'fire-making' badge, a 'first aid' badge, and a 'parade marshal' badge. The last one is, in fact, weirdly useful.",
      "sceneTitle": "Augie's Sash",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Use the sash organizationally",
          "consequence": "Be the leader.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mock the sash gently",
          "consequence": "Tone.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "A woman named Denise appears with a baseball bat and saves you from a small mob. She is, immediately, in charge.",
      "sceneTitle": "Denise from the Strip Club",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Defer to Denise",
          "consequence": "Smart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Earn her respect",
          "consequence": "Slow.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "The hardware store has nails, baseball bats, and a single guy named Ron behind the counter who has, apparently, been waiting for this.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hardware Store",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Recruit Ron",
          "consequence": "More hands.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take supplies and go",
          "consequence": "Speed.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "The mall, of course. Inside is a stage being set up for the high school party tonight. The party may still be on. Half the senior class doesn't know yet.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Mall",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Warn the party",
          "consequence": "Save lives.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Use the mall to fortify",
          "consequence": "Defend.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "The retirement home is, surprisingly, mostly fine. The residents have, for various reasons, mistaken the apocalypse for a fire drill.",
      "sceneTitle": "Old People's Home",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Brief them carefully",
          "consequence": "Care.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Leave them; they're safe",
          "consequence": "Move on.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "Kendall, Carter's crush, calls his phone. She is at the party. She is, somehow, alive. She is, also, smarter than Carter has ever realized.",
      "sceneTitle": "Carter's Crush",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pivot to the party",
          "consequence": "Crush as motive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay on plan",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "A zombie cat. You both want to laugh and don't.",
      "sceneTitle": "Zombie Cat",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Distract it",
          "consequence": "Soft.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Slingshot it",
          "consequence": "Pragmatic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "The school is locked. The football coach is, weirdly, leading a militia inside. He is, weirdly, doing it well.",
      "sceneTitle": "The High School",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Join the militia",
          "consequence": "Numbers.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Avoid the militia",
          "consequence": "Loner.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "You have, the badge book says, eighteen inches at minimum for accuracy. You discover, in practice, more like twelve.",
      "sceneTitle": "Slingshot Range",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Practice on something static",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Use it live",
          "consequence": "Battle test.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "Augie, who has been the dorkiest of you for nine years, makes a move that saves Denise. The moment is small. The moment is huge.",
      "sceneTitle": "Augie's Brave Moment",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Make sure he knows",
          "consequence": "Tell him.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let it be",
          "consequence": "Some bravery is private.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "An above-ground pool, a trampoline, two suburban kids' inheritance. You and Carter use them to clear a fence.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Trampoline",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Catch up to Denise",
          "consequence": "Reconvene.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Find Augie first",
          "consequence": "Friend first.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "The mall stage is up. Half the high school is there. Music is loud. Nobody has noticed the zombies in the food court yet.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mall, Round Two",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Cut the music",
          "consequence": "Get attention.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lock the doors first",
          "consequence": "Contain.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "Kendall, faced with the situation, organizes the party into a defense in under two minutes. You realize you have wildly underestimated her.",
      "sceneTitle": "Kendall's Smarter",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Follow her lead",
          "consequence": "Smart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Coordinate as equals",
          "consequence": "Pair up.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "The coach's militia arrives, late, but timely. Their plan is bad. Your plan is also bad. Together the plans become acceptable.",
      "sceneTitle": "Coach's Militia",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Merge the plans",
          "consequence": "Pragmatic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay separate",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "You orchestrate, against all reason, a trampoline-based charge that picks off the perimeter zombies in a way that, in a different timeline, would have been a YouTube video.",
      "sceneTitle": "Trampoline Charge",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Commit to it",
          "consequence": "Funny is fine.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Cover for it tactically",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "Augie's parade marshal badge actually saves the entire defensive arrangement by organizing them in a pattern only he knows. Augie, you realize, is the hero of this movie.",
      "sceneTitle": "Augie's Sash, Again",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Promote Augie publicly",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let him have it quietly",
          "consequence": "Style.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Final wave. The football field. The stadium lights are on. You and Carter and Augie and Denise hold the south corner. Kendall holds the north.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Last Wave",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Charge",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hold the line",
          "consequence": "Patient.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "Sunrise. The town is, mostly, scoured. The bus carrying the surviving teenagers pulls away. You and Augie sit on the bleachers eating, somehow, leftover pancakes.",
      "sceneTitle": "Daylight",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Celebrate",
          "consequence": "You won.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sit quietly",
          "consequence": "Decompress.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "Monday morning. School is, weirdly, in session. The town has decided to call this a 'fire' for insurance reasons.",
      "sceneTitle": "After School",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stay scouts",
          "consequence": "Sash on.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_sash"
        },
        {
          "text": "Quit scouts to be normal",
          "consequence": "Sash off.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_kendall"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_quiet"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_sash",
      "text": "You stay in scouts. You become an Eagle Scout. You write your application essay about the night the trampoline saved a high school. The reviewer, who has heard everything, says it is the most specific essay he has read.",
      "sceneTitle": "Eagle Scout, Eventually",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Eagle Scout, Eventually"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_kendall",
      "text": "Carter and Kendall become a couple. Augie, somehow, becomes the most popular kid at school. You become the friend who knows. You go on to a normal life that, every Halloween, gets weirder.",
      "sceneTitle": "Kendall and the World",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Kendall and the World"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_quiet",
      "text": "You quietly graduate. You never tell most people the truth about that night. You keep the sash in a box in your closet. Sometimes, late, you take it out and put it on. It still fits.",
      "sceneTitle": "Quiet Senior Year",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Quiet Senior Year"
    }
  ]
}
